  "details": "When the camera screen is held in the hand in VR and set to the Default anchor, the raycast from the player's laser pointer disappears when trying to select an autofocus point in the center in Auto or Semi Auto focus mode. Likely cause: the (invisible) camera lens model is blocking the raycast from reaching the screen.\n\nTo reproduce:\n\n1. Open up the Photo or Stream Camera in VR\n\n2. Ensure Anchor is set to Default\n\n3. Set Focus to Auto or Semi Auto\n\n4. While holding the camera in one hand, use the laser point on your other hand to select a focus point in the corner of the camera viewfinder\n\n5. Now attempt to select the center of the viewfinder again\n\nExpected result: Focus point returns to the center of the viewfinder\n\nActual result: Laser pointer disappears while pointed within some radius of the center",
